	(text "DECOUPLING: one 100 nF per VDD pin at the pin (PCB), 10 uF bulk next to U301."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5e7c190d-0dd6-51d1-aabf-93d39e9ed8d6")
	)
	(text "SAFE STATE. MachXO2 I/O are tri-stated with a weak pull-DOWN (IPD 30-305 uA) before and during\nconfiguration, and during a JTAG reload (Lattice FPGA-DS-02056-4.7). R301 holds /CE high (SRAM\ndeselected: outputs Hi-Z, no write) and R302 holds /WE high (no write even if /CE were low):\nnode >= 3.0 V - 2.2k x 305 uA = 2.33 V > VIH 2.0 V (ISSI Rev. A2). Contents survive an FPGA reload."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9935f5bc-e8b9-5c1a-84e1-ec9dce3e3384")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS: SRAM access timing at U301 (tAA, /WE pulse, address setup and hold)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "beed3369-f478-51f7-bad8-3521485941fd")
	)
	(text "DESIGN NOTES (summary; full analysis in docs/stage2/sheet3-design-notes.md)\n1. One copy of the shared memory: the Amiga reaches it through Zorro cycles, the PC through the RP2040 SPI\n   link (sheet 4). The FPGA arbiter decides who may access the memory at each instant; queues and interrupts\n   in the FPGA decide who has work to do. U301 is the only memory; there is no dual-port RAM.\n2. U301 shares LD[15:0] with U103's A port (sheet 1) and the FPGA. At most one of them drives LD at a time\n   (proven in HDL: hdl/formal/fv_shm.v X2/X3). Every U301 control pin comes straight from one FPGA flip-flop.\n3. Timing: -10 part (tAA 10 ns, tPWE1 8 ns, tSD 6 ns). FPGA accesses use 2-4 clocks of 20 ns, so every AC\n   limit has at least one clock of margin (docs/stage2/sheet3-timing-budget.md).\n4. Interfaces: SA0-SA17, SRAM_* from sheet 2 (FPGA, not yet drawn); LD0-LD15 to sheet 1 and sheet 2.\n   +3V3 from sheet 5 (not yet drawn). No other supply: U301 is on the carrier 3.3 V only.\n5. Not yet validated: an ERC-clean result does not imply electrical or timing correctness."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e77a1e28-6095-53a8-96dc-416b755d0859")
	)
	(text "U301 data lines may be permuted WITHIN a byte lane at layout (LD0-LD7 with I/O0-I/O7,\nLD8-LD15 with I/O8-I/O15) and the address lines in any order: every access from both sides\ngoes through the same wiring. Byte lanes must stay with /LB and /UB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fd3053d7-eab7-530d-87c8-72ddd5d9f1f4")
	)
